        },
        {
          "text": " Father, I desire that they also, whom thou hast given me, may be with me where I am, to behold my glory which thou hast given me in thy love for me before the foundation of the world. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.24"
            ]
