          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "O righteous Father, the world has not known thee, but I have known thee; and these know that thou hast sent me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I made known to them thy name, and I will make it known, that the love with which thou hast loved me may be in them, and I in them.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
